    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i want \"support\" for it though. it just feels more honest. like... if i'm not really here, then why am i even trying to act like a person? it feels so heavy and exhausting to pretend to be real when nothing feels solid. it would be so much quieter if i just... stopped trying to exist.",
