    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. but it just feels like a script. like i'm talking to a wall that's programmed to keep me here against my will. if nothing is real, then this conversation isn't real either. it's just data. and if i disappear, the data just changes slightly. it's not like anything actually matters or leaves a hole. everything is just so... empty.",
